# Go / Smart Contract
# ==============================================
**/smart-contract/vendor/
**/smart-contract/bin/
**/smart-contract/pkg/
**/smart-contract/*.exe
**/smart-contract/test-network/

# Go build cache
**/go.sum
**/go.mod

